# ==============================================================================
# 1313 PRO ADVISORS LTD — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
# ==============================================================================
# CURRENT STATUS:
# The website runs completely as a client-side Vite + React static application.
# NO environment variables are strictly required for the core website to build,
# run, render all 8 pages, or handle the contact form (which uses client-side
# reference generation and direct mailto dispatch).
#
# Below are OPTIONAL variables if external third-party services are integrated later.
# ==============================================================================

# [OPTIONAL] Formspree / Webhook Endpoint for Form Submissions
# Purpose: If replacing direct client-side mailto dispatch with an automated email endpoint
# Required: No (Optional)
# Where to obtain: Formspree (https://formspree.io), Resend, or your custom API backend
# Where to configure: Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables
# VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your_form_id

# [OPTIONAL] Google Search Console Verification Tag
# Purpose: Alternative method to verify domain ownership in Google Search Console
# Required: No (Optional, HTML file or DNS TXT record is preferred)
# Where to obtain: Google Search Console > Add Property > HTML Tag
# VITE_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=your_gsc_verification_code_here

# [OPTIONAL] Canonical Site URL Override
# Purpose: Override the default canonical URL (defaults to https://1313proadvisors.ltd)
# Required: No (Defaults to https://1313proadvisors.ltd)
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://1313proadvisors.ltd

